  _lines:
  - name: ???
    sentence: 'Hello. How''re you doing, pal? '
    modifiers:
    - type: 1
      value: 0.02
      triggerOrder: 0
  - name: ???
    sentence: 'I see you got my invitation. Thank you for meeting me here. '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'I''m Marc, by the way. Marc Brownie.  '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'Neat name, right? Very legally distinct. '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'Well, you must be wondering, ''What''s up with those rocks you got
      down there? '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'You see, I''m building a rock pile. The BIGGEST rock pile. '
    modifiers:
    - type: 3
      value: 0.3
      triggerOrder: 9
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'It''s my dream. Always been, always will be. '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'Now, the question is, will you help me? '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: '... judging by your silence, I''m guessing that''s a yes! '
    modifiers:
    - type: 3
      value: 0.15
      triggerOrder: 1
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'Cool. I''m gonna be hurling rocks at you, and you''re gonna catch
      ''em. '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'We all know that''s the easiest way of building a big pile of rocks. '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: ...Let me give you a demonstration, OK?
    modifiers: []
